{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41202","headline":"哭赵州和尚二首 二 · 王熔","name":"哭赵州和尚二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佛日西倾祖印隳，珠沈丹沼月沈辉。\n影敷丈室炉烟惨，风起禅堂松韵微。\n只履乍来留化迹，五天何处又逢归。\n解空弟子绝悲喜，犹自潸然对雪帏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王熔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}